            "title": "Red Cat introduces FANG line of FPV drones",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Red Cat (RCAT) Holdings announced the launch of its FANG line of NDAA-compliant First Person View drones, starting with the 7-inch FANG F7. Initially developed through a U.S. military lab program, FANG has progressed from concept to field-ready, providing secure, retrievable FPV systems that meet federal procurement requirements. The FANG line, part of Red Cat\u2019s Arachnid Family of Systems, provides operators with secure, American-made FPV drones that combine performance with significant savings.",
